From 27098ce374220832d6b3a76ac60548c4e3a88c05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:16:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/53] kaiair: full Cantelli sigma sqrt(Var[S]+Var[NI]) per
 pktR_CR Eq.(2)/ch.4; LDP-composed DL BLER target; ul_sinr_target_db telemetry

- pktr_link_state now tracks signal-side EWMA mean/var alongside NI; sigma_sinr_db()
  is the std of (S-I) the papers require - the cushion and E_max were using std(NI) only.
- pktr_dl_power_controller target = 1 - ldp_effective_tx_beta(...) - the same single
  LDP composition point as the UL cushion (deadline -> p_req(N(D))).
- Metrics JSON emits ul_sinr_target_db = live gamma + cushion, cushion gated by the
  live actuate toggle so the GUI tracking view reads the true effective target.
- 39 unit tests pass (10 link-state incl. paper-anchored sigma tests, 14 runtime-config,
  8 DL-controller incl. LDP composition, 7 LDP).
